  "details": "Load a world with at least two users.\n\nSome remote users' cameras may appear floating above the world origin facing down, even if those users don't have their camera enabled.\n\nIf the camera's owner opens their camera, it behaves as expected again.\n\nNo Spout stream is active, verified by OBS.\n\nNoticed in the spawn point of Murder 4, and the centre of Curin's Room.\n\nSee in the following image, where one user can see a camera. Prior to this, both users could see the other's camera in this location, but I lost connection before taking a screenshot.",
